  <name>Brevlada</name>
  <summary>Read and send mail with GNOME Online Accounts</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Brevlada is an email client for GNOME. Connect mail accounts through
    GNOME Online Accounts, browse conversations, and compose replies.</p>
    <p>Messages are cached locally for browsing while offline. HTML messages
    are displayed with remote media disabled until you choose to load it.</p>
  </description>
